window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Taking candids turned into so much more...</p> <p>Marriage never looked easy on the outside looking in, but with Simon, life had been better than ever. I found my soulmate in a man who cared for me, loved me feverishly, and protected me against all odds. But regardless of the love we shared for each other, our eyes often roamed to others. Even at night, when we spent time in each other's arms, we mused over the ideas of what it would be like to explore happily again, while remaining committed to each other.</p> <p>But fear always held us back.</p> <p>Then they entered the picture.</p> <p>Nyx. Asher. And Rhodes.</p> <p>Our best friends.</p> <p>One daring video to my husband later, and I found myself at the mercy of all four of them days later. All under the disguise of their cosplays’ personas—the outfits and attitudes that started it all in the first place.</p> <p>Taking candids turned into so much more...</p> <p>What if we can’t go back to just friends?</p> <p>Even if it was just supposed to be one night of fun.</p>"; 
